  dialogueLines:
  - Humans only cut! My slime is useless. I'm worthless!
  - "A shield\u2026 I never use it."
  - I'm so angry and helpless. Every day I watch trees are fall.
  - "Power\u2026 I'll try to believe it."
  - Will the forest ever come back?
  - "\u2026I am willing."
  - The animals are scare because of me. I feel so guilty.
